# valgrind memcheck suppressions for core-tests (tools/sanitize/valgrind.sh, docs/testing/sanitizers.md).
# Only reports that are not about our memory: an entry here never covers a frame of core/src.

# gtest prints a test parameter it has no PrintTo for as the raw bytes of the object, padding included: the
# padding bytes are uninitialized and formatting them is reported. Our structs are fine.
{
   gtest-print-bytes-in-object-padding
   Memcheck:Cond
   ...
   fun:*PrintByteSegmentInObjectTo*
}
{
   gtest-print-bytes-in-object-padding-value8
   Memcheck:Value8
   ...
   fun:*PrintByteSegmentInObjectTo*
}
